nodecode-codex-truly is a rewrite of kyssta-exe's kyssta-exe/hermes-codex-truly:

  https://github.com/kyssta-exe/hermes-codex-truly
  commit 1913d2a0a4b2dd3e4283af5c78241de4d3a2995e
